{
  "key": 17506,
  "messages": [
    {
      "id": "msg_0116_D37R0101_00000",
      "en_US": [
        "I was challenged to a battle\n",
        "downstairs.\r",
        "It’s rough down there. You’d better\n",
        "be careful."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0116_D37R0101_00001",
      "en_US": [
        "You look like an earnest youth.\n",
        "How come you ended up in\f",
        "Team Rocket...?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0116_D37R0101_00002",
      "en_US": [
        "Team Rocket never stops bothering\n",
        "people, do they?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0116_D37R0101_00003",
      "en_US": [
        "There are some shops downstairs...\r",
        "But there are also Trainers.\n",
        "I’m scared to go down there."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0116_D37R0101_00004",
      "en_US": [
        "Yes...\n",
        "Team Rocket can use the tunnel, too."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0116_D37R0101_00005",
      "en_US": [
        "All the people working at the tunnel\n",
        "left. No one wants Team Rocket to\f",
        "give them a hard time."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0116_D37R0101_00006",
      "en_US": [
        "Lyra: Hi, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}.\n",
        "You are just in time!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0116_D37R0101_00007",
      "en_US": [
        "Lyra: When you follow this tunnel,\n",
        "you’ll see a Dress-Up Shop.\r",
        "That’s where your Pokémon can put on\n",
        "Accessories to dress up and\f",
        "take pictures!\r",
        "By the way, here is the Fashion Case!\r",
        "Did you say you want it?\n",
        "I knew it!\r",
        "This is a present from me!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0116_D37R0101_00008",
      "en_US": [
        "Lyra: Keep Accessories in the\n",
        "Fashion Case, OK?\r",
        "I should get going.\n",
        "See you!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0116_D37R0101_00009",
      "en_US": [
        "Ethan: Hi, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}.\n",
        "You are just in time!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0116_D37R0101_00010",
      "en_US": [
